    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47560" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠρίον</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>mound, barrow, tomb</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔνθ᾽ ἄρ᾽ Ἀχιλλεὺς φράσσατο Πατρόκλῳ
				μέγα ἠ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				23.126
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				11
			</span></i> (Delph.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(1).168
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Rhodes</span>), <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.1165
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠρία νεκύων,
			Κορύθοιο</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				2.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				108
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἵσατο βωμόν . . , ἠ. ὄφρα γένοιτο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Epigr.Gr.</u>
					411
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Patara</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ χθονὸς ἠρία τεῦχον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					7.180
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Apollonid.
			</span></i>), cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Epigr.Gr.</u>
				214.1
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Rhenea</span>); in Prose, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ath.</u>
				55.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				57.67
			</span></i>, prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Din.
				2.17
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Lycurg.
				109
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>TG</u>
				9
			</span></i>, etc.: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠρία τῶν ψυχῶν τὰς βίβλους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Them.
					<u>Or.</u>
					4.59d
				</span></i>
			. (Derived from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔρα</span> by <i><span class="en">
				Harp.
			</span></i>, etc.: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ϝηρίον</span> prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>)</div>
